    <briefdescription>
<para>Class representing a partial derivative of a <ref refid="classastrea_1_1astro_1_1Keplerian" kindref="compound">Keplerian</ref> state vector. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class encapsulates the velocity and acceleration components of a vehicle in <ref refid="classastrea_1_1astro_1_1Keplerian" kindref="compound">Keplerian</ref> coordinates. It is used to represent the rate of change of the <ref refid="classastrea_1_1astro_1_1Keplerian" kindref="compound">Keplerian</ref> elements with respect to time.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>The <ref refid="classastrea_1_1astro_1_1KeplerianPartial" kindref="compound">KeplerianPartial</ref> class is typically used in astrodynamics calculations involving orbital mechanics. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
